cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this taxonomy or the visual DNA scheme, cite it as below."
title: "ai-honeypot-bestiary: a Linnaean taxonomy for web agents"
abstract: >-
  An interpretation layer that classifies already-captured web traffic into a
  seven-rank Linnaean taxonomy, groups observations into species, and derives a
  deterministic visual identity from each species signature.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Swymer
    given-names: Derrick
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Maximusdurden/ai-honeypot-bestiary"
keywords:
  - bot detection
  - ai agents
  - crawlers
  - honeypot
  - taxonomy
  - bestiary
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-09"
